## Phase 2b: Umbrel's own backup of A, restored onto B, a fresh umbrelOS 2.0.0 never set up
INFO  first try: Umbrel couldn't mount the network share. umbrelOS in Docker uses the droplet's Ubuntu
INFO  kernel, which lacked nls_utf8 (it comes in linux-modules-extra). No backup was taken. Installed
INFO  that package on the droplet and ran again.
